	v.push_back(p1);
	v.push_back(p2);
	v.push_back(p3);
	v.push_back(p4);
	v.push_back(p5);

	Person p("诸葛亮", 35);

	int num = count(v.begin(), v.end(), p);
	cout << "和诸葛亮同岁的人数:" << num << endl;
}

int main() {

	test01();
	test02();

	system("pause");

	return 0;
}
```

#### 23.2.6 count_if

**作用**：按条件统计元素个数。

**函数原型**：`count_if(iterator beg, iterator end, _Pred);`

**示例**：

```c++
